        identifier IS "L.1/2017"
        title IS "Dormant Bank Accounts (Jersey) Law 2017"
        `made on` IS NOTHING
        `comes into force` IS `on a day stated` (YMD 2019 12 16)
        `what it does to the Law` IS "Schedule 1: at the beginning of paragraph 2(4)(a) the words “subject to Article 20(1) of the Dormant Bank Accounts (Jersey) Law 2017,” are inserted, and at the beginning of paragraph 4(7) “The” is replaced by “Subject to Article 20(1) of the Dormant Bank Accounts (Jersey) Law 2017, the” (Article 30(3))"
        `text among the sources` IS TRUE
        `date in force shown by the sources` IS FALSE

-- Row E6.  L.13/2019 Schedule 3 paragraph 1 replaces “Income Tax (Jersey) Law 1961” by “Revenue Administration (Jersey) Law 2019” in the definition of “Comptroller”.
-- R&O.136/2019 Article 1 (made 10 December 2019): the Revenue Administration (Jersey) Law 2019 comes into force on 1st January 2020 other than Articles 17, 18 and 19.
